ell resources for money and buy “special” goods. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game also has an excitation system on which some scenes depend. Estimated time to complete the game is 45 minutes. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n[Controls] Keyboard or gamepad controls. <br />\r\nKeyboard: <br />\r\nZ - Attack. <br />\r\nX – jump. <br />\r\nI - opening inventory. <br />\r\nC - masturbation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n[Other] If the game seems complicated, you can lower the difficulty level in the settings. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you are interested in my games, visit my Patreon! Link: <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ChimeraZak\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/ChimeraZak</a>"}]}], "description": "突然の地震がアズミの家を破壊した。森の中の生活はとても危険だ。モンスターが襲ってくる前に家を建て直さなければならない!", "short_introduction": "突然の地震がアズミの家を破壊した。森の中の生活はとても危険だ。モンスターが襲ってくる前に家を建て直さなければならない!", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ269660.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794961840}